# Original photos straight from a camera or phone are large and usually contain GPS
# location data. Keep them outside the repository and commit only the web copies
# (resized, location data removed, named YYYY-MM-DD-name.jpg / .webp, no spaces).
# Files with spaces in their names are originals or exports, not web copies:
assets/img/**/* *
# Phone photos in HEIC format are never used directly by the site
assets/img/**/*.heic
